      <div type="layout" source="#source-438-581" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
        <p source="#source-459-581"><seg source="#source-459-468">猶南町</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-474-525"><seg source="#source-468-474">むば</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-498-510">（乳母）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-525-581">にもよろしく御伝へ御たのみ申あげ候。</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-581-1048"><seg source="#source-581-590">御文難</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-590-602">レ</note><seg source="#source-602-617">有、然ニ御</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-629-686"><seg source="#source-617-629">ちうもん</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-659-671">（注文）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-686-707">の銀の板うちの</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-719-773"><seg source="#source-707-719">かんざし</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-749-758">（簪）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-773-857">と云ものに、京打、江戸打と云あり、板打中にも色々の通り在</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-857-869">レ</note><seg source="#source-869-920">之、画図でも御こしなれバ、わかり可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-920-932">レ</note><seg source="#source-932-992">申候。然りといへども後便ニ一つさし出し可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-992-1004">レ</note><seg source="#source-1004-1048">申と存じ候。御まち、かしこ。</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1048-1119" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-1069-1119"><seg source="#source-1069-1084">三月廿四日</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1084-1119" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(3)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=3"><seg source="#source-1114-1119">龍</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1119-1166" style="padding-inline-start: 1em">
        <p source="#source-1140-1166"><seg source="#source-1140-1166">呈　ふぐの春猪様</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1166-1232" style="padding-inline-start: 8em">
        <p source="#source-1187-1232"><seg source="#source-1187-1196">御前へ</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1196-1232" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(2)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=2"><seg source="#source-1226-1232">龍馬</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
